      "updated": 1777918888375,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Setting up the communication standard\n    - a consist communication standard is need, if not issues could be there\n\nHow to remember the events?\n\n   - Manual way -> write event details in dairy? \n           - dairy is storage \n           - employee is request processing solution\n           - backup mechanism if dairy is lost\n           - think about scale as well \n\n   - we are a software company we need to automate this process -> now how ?\n            - Now let's build a software REMINDLY \n           \n        ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Setting up the communication standard\n    - a consist communication standard is need, if not issues could be there\n\nHow to remember the events?\n\n   - Manual way -> write event details in dairy? \n           - dairy is storage \n           - employee is request processing solution\n           - backup mechanism if dairy is lost\n           - think about scale as well \n\n   - we are a software company we need to automate this process -> now how ?\n            - Now let's build a software REMINDLY \n           \n        ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
